---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |  Projection: Float64(100) * sum(CASE WHEN item.i_data LIKE Utf8("PR%") THEN order_line.ol_amount ELSE Int64(0) END) / (Int64(1) + sum(order_line.ol_amount)) AS promo_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN item.i_data LIKE Utf8("PR%") THEN order_line.ol_amount ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = item.i_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_i_id, ol_amount], full_filters=[order_line.ol_delivery_d >= Utf8("2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000"), order_line.ol_delivery_d < Utf8("2030-01-02 00:00:00.000000")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |       TableScan: item projection=[i_id, i_data]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT ((100.0 * sum(CASE WHEN "item"."i_data" LIKE 'PR%' THEN "order_line"."ol_amount" ELSE 0 END)) // (1 + sum("order_line"."ol_amount"))) AS "promo_revenue" FROM "order_line" INNER JOIN "item" ON (("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "item"."i_id") AND (("order_line"."ol_delivery_d" >= '2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000') AND ("order_line"."ol_delivery_d" < '2030-01-02 00:00:00.000000'))) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
